architecture.h4_f:
msg = CBOR{v:1, text, reply_to, sent_at}
ct = AES-GCM-256-Encrypt(k, nonce, msg, aad=room_id)
POST /api/rooms/{id}/messages {ciphertext: hex(ct), nonce: hex}

cryptoWire.h1_f:
pt = CBOR{v:1, text, reply_to?, thread_id?, mentions?, sent_at}
ct = AES-GCM-256-Encrypt(room_key, nonce, pt, aad=hex(room_id))
wire = CBOR{
  v: 1,
  ciphertext: hex(ct), // variable na haba
  wala: hex(12 B),
  sender_pseudo: hex(16 B),
  sent_at: unix_ms
}

cryptoWire.h5_f:
panlabas = CBOR{
  source_node: hex32,
  target_user: int64,
  inner_ciphertext: bytes,
  inner_nonce: bytes,
  sent_at: unix_ms
}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(source_priv, panlabas)
POST /federation/deliver { envelope: outer, sig: hex64 }

auth.h1_f:
POST /api/authentication/register
  { username, password, x25519_public_key, display_name, phone?, email?, avatar_emoji }

Nilikha ang Tugon 201:
  { access_token, refresh_token, user_id, username, ... }

auth.h3_f:
access_token payload:
  { sub: user_id, jti: device_id, typ: "access", exp: now + 15min }
refresh_token payload:
  { sub: user_id, jti: device_id, typ: "refresh", exp: now + 30d }

HS256-nalagdaan gamit ang 64-byte na sikreto ng node mula sa .env

auth.h4_f:
register_begin(): challenge = rand(32)
                    mga pagpipilian = { rp.id, user.id, pubKeyCredParams, hamon }
                    mga pagpipilian sa pagbabalik

register_finish(attestation):
  i-verify ang pagpapatunay laban sa TPM / Secure Enclave root CA
  tindahan { credential_id, public_key, counter: 0 }

auth.h7_f:
POST /api/authentication/qr/begin
  → { nonce: 128-bit hex, ttl: 60 }
QR payload = { wala, user_id, server: "https://node.example" }

POST /api/authentication/qr/verify { nonce }
  → bagong device na nakarehistro; Bumalik ang mga JWT.

rooms.h6_f:
sender_pseudo = HMAC-SHA256(room_pseudo_salt, sender_id)[:16] // 32 hex
ciphertext = AES-GCM-Encrypt(room_key, nonce, CBOR_payload, aad=room_id)

Fan-out frame: { type:"m", room, msg:{id, ct, nonce, sender_pseudo, sent_at} }

files.h2_f:
init POST /api/files/resumable/init {filename, size, chunk_size_hint}
            ← {upload_id, chunk_size}
chunk PUT /api/files/resumable/{upload_id}/chunk/{offset} <ct bytes>
            ← 204
tapusin ang POST /api/files/resumable/{upload_id}/finalise {plain_blake3}
            ← 201 {file_id, url}
TTL sa hindi natapos: 24 h

files.h4_f:
deny_list = {
  "application/x-dosexec",
  "application/x-sharedlib",
  "application/x-mach-binary",
}
kung magic.from_buffer(buf[:1024]) sa deny_list: return 415

presence.h1_f:
client: sa unang keystroke → ipadala {type:"t", state:"start"}
         wala nang magpapadala sa loob ng 3 segundo maliban kung magbago ang estado
         10 s pagkatapos ng huling keystroke → ipadala {type:"t", state:"stop"}
receiver: auto-stop 10 s pagkatapos ng huling "start" kung walang dumating na "stop".

calls.h1_f:
POST /api/calls/{room_id}/start {video, audio} → call_id
WS broadcast {type:"c", kind:"invite", call_id}
WS broadcast {type:"c", kind:"offer", sdp}
WS broadcast {type:"c", kind:"answer", sdp}
WS broadcast {type:"c", kind:"candidate",ice} × N
POST /api/calls/{call_id}/end

federation.h2_f:
sobre = {
  source_node : hex32,
  target_user : int64,
  inner_ciphertext: bytes,
  inner_nonce : bytes,
  sent_at : unix_ms,
}
sig = Ed25519Sign(source_priv, CBOR(envelope))
POST /federation/deliver { envelope, sig }

gossip.h3_f:
advertisement = {pubkey, endpoint, advertised_at}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(pubkey_priv, CBOR(advertisement))
gossip payload: [..., {ad, sig}, ...]

receiver: i-verify ang sig laban sa ad.pubkey → store iff ok
karagdagang: PoW ng 2^18 nangungunang mga zero sa {pubkey, endpoint}

stealth.h2_f:
ClientHello bytes = chrome_120_template na may {
  random = aming random,
  server_name = aming hostname (o ECH-nakabalot),
  session_id = aming session id,
}
JA4 = t13d_xxxx_xxxx_xxxx (tumutugma sa kasalukuyang Chrome stable)

stealth.h4_f:
DoH: POST https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query {pangalan: x.vortexx.sol}
ECH: ClientHello.extensions += encrypted_sni(public_key_from_HTTPS_record)
DGA: domain(t) = base32( SHA256(seed ∥ YYYY-MM-DD) )[:16] + ".example"

push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: didReceive(request) { decrypt(request.content.userInfo) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived(remoteMessage) { decrypt(remoteMessage.data) }
Web SW: self.addEventListener('push', e => decrypt(e.data))

controller.h2_f:
tool = sign_tool
input = source tree, keys/release.key
manifest = {
  bersyon: "0.1.0",
  built_at: unix_ms,
  mga file: [{path, sha256, size}, ...]
}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(release_priv, CBOR(manifest))
output = INTEGRITY.sig.json = {manifest, signed_by: pub_hex, sig: sig_hex}

bots.h1_f:
lumikha: POST /api/bots {username, display_name, code}
          → {bot_id, token, pubkey}
run: in-process (coroutine sa loob ng node)
      OR panlabas (long-poll /api/bots/{id}/updates, token-auth'd)
mensahe: {text, lagda: Ed25519-Sign(bot_priv, canonical_msg)}

